# Check in each look. Known earlier results: store (Software) rows were missing in Rust, ranking tie-order for "fi"; re-check both.
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
rec sp-type 1 key fir
note Results appear within one frame of the last key; first changed frame after the last key: Rust not later than QML. Selection on row 0.
wait 2
shot sp-fir
note Results for "fir": Applications plus (after 1.5 s) a Software group / Top Hit with "Get - Flathub" rows as in QML; selection on row 0.
key -k Down -k Down
shot sp-down2
note Selection on row 2 (third row).
key -k Up -k Up -k Up -k Up -k Up
shot sp-up5
note Up x5 stops at row 0 (no wrap).
key -k Tab -k Tab -k Tab -k Tab -k Tab -k Tab -k Tab -k Tab
shot sp-tab-wrap
note Repeated Tab wraps to row 0 after the last row (selection index visible; compare with QML).
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key 2+2
wait 1
shot sp-22
note Answer card "4" first.
key -k Return
wait 1
setup sh -c 'wl-paste'
shot sp-22-closed
note Search closed; clipboard holds 4 (wl-paste in the setup line).
# MANUAL: /.bash file rows arrive later; keep selection on the 2nd file title while more arrive (no files in sandbox)
# MANUAL: file row: Shift+Space and Ctrl+Y open Quick Look (no files in sandbox)
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key ?hello
key -k Return
wait 2
shot sp-ask
note With no AI set up, "?hello" + Return opens Settings on the AI page and closes Search.
key -k Escape
setup ipc panels close
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
# Ask button with an empty field (Glass (1280,244) / Material (1280,244) approx.)
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 1280 244 200 sleep 100 click
wait 2
shot sp-ask-empty
note Ask (sparkle) with empty field opens the sidebar (or Settings AI if no AI); compare with QML. Click may not register on layer surfaces.
ipc panels close
# reopen after typing
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key hello
wait 1
key -k Escape
wait 1
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
shot sp-reopen
note Reopened Search: field empty, no results.
key -k Escape
